      "message": "Hi,\nI can do that but I have the following findings:\n\n\"build.config.gki\" is also included by \"build.config.virtual_device\", which in turn is included in many virtual device configs (probably too widespread?):\n\nhttps://source.corp.google.com/search?q\u003dcommon-modules%2Fvirtual-device%2Fbuild.config.virtual_device\u0026sq\u003dp:%5Eandroid-common-kernel$\u0026start\u003d1\n\nGKI_CERTIFICATION_TOOLS is only required for arm64 \u0026 x86_64 GKI targets.\n\nLooks like BUILD_SYSTEM_DLKM\u003d1 is only enabled in those two configs.\nhttps://cs.android.com/search?q\u003dBUILD_SYSTEM_DLKM%20%20f:build.config*",
